{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119832","id":3758270091,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gAqaL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119832","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119832.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119832.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119832","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119832/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119832/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119832/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f131eb5eacb8ab41c159d78bf2adada27b24b4d2","number":119832,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Localization support for SpinBox's prefix and suffix","user":{"login":"Leroymilo","id":88249282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MjQ5Mjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88249282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo","html_url":"https://github.com/Leroymilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary of Changes\r\n\r\nThis adds supports for localization with Godot's built-in system of `SpinBox`'s `prefix` and `suffix`.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nI was learning how Godot's localization system works by applying it to [my current project](https://gitlab.com/leroymilo/open-love-hue) when I noticed that the prefixes of my `SpinBox` controls would not appear in the .pot template file generated.\r\nAfter searching about this in the issues an proposals, I decided to look how complicated it would be to implement it in order to make a proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14923\r\nThe workaround would require adding translation keys manually to the .pot template, localize prefix and suffix on scene ready, and handle NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED to update them.\r\n\r\n## Technical Overview\r\n\r\nThe change is very simple, but this is my first PR so please pardon me if this is too detailed. It adds:\r\n- \"prefix\" and \"suffix\" to the properties searched by the translation parser plugin (might be overkill since they only exist for `SpinBox`, but I don't know enough to see another way)\r\n- `prefix_translated` and `suffix_translated` to the `SpinBox` class\r\n- handling of translation in setters\r\n- text editing and submitting with translated prefix and suffix\r\n- handling of NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nBuilt with no errors, succesfully tested in the mentioned project: translation keys are added to the .pot template, and translations are applied, as well as updated on locale changed.\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n \r\nI looked at the implementation of `LineEdit.placeholder_text` to see what needs to be done for a localizable field, so I might have missed something that I'm not aware of, but I'm pretty confident that the current changes to `SpinBox` have no issue.\r\nI'm a bit less confident about adding stuff to the translation plugin's `lookup_properties`, although I couldn't think of anything else \"prefix\" and \"suffix\" refer to.\r\nI wasn't able to setup my IDE for code completion and style checks since I'm using VSCodium with clangd (no MS C/C++ extension...), but I would be surprised a change this small breaks style guidelines.\r\n\r\nIn the end, I strongly believe that these changes are much simpler than a potential workaround with manual .pot editing and additional gdscript overhead.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-27T22:05:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T17:41:14Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T17:41:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Leroymilo:spinbox_localization","ref":"spinbox_localization","repo":{"id":1251727823,"node_id":"R_kgDOSpvZzw","name":"godot","full_name":"Leroymilo/godot","owner":{"login":"Leroymilo","id":88249282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MjQ5Mjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88249282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo","html_url":"https://github.com/Leroymilo","followers_url":"https://api.g